# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. Tabular Data: Exclude data CSVs/TSVs by default, allow small configs/manifests
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.csv
*.tsv

# Unignore small configuration/manifest CSVs and TSVs
!**/overrides/*.csv
!**/overrides/*.tsv
!**/configs/*.csv
!**/configs/*.tsv
!**/*manifest*.csv
!**/*manifest*.tsv
!**/*mapping*.csv
!**/*mapping*.tsv
!ARTIFACT_INVENTORY.tsv
!PERMISSIONS_MODIFIED_TIER_A.tsv
!DUPLICATES.tsv
!registry.tsv
!MOVES.tsv

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 8. Large Generated / Concatenated Text Bundles
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*concat*.txt
*concat*.tsv
*review_package*.txt
fiberphotometry_code_review.zip*

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 9. Whitelist Essential Repository Code, Configs, Documentation
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!.gitignore
!.gitignore.legacy
!LICENSE
!README.md
!pyproject.toml